http-response-jq (?i)^https://a\.qiumibao\.com/ios/config/\? '.all_sections.match_sections.labels |= (if . then (.blacks_disable |= if . then map(select(. != "游戏")) else . end) | (.show |= if . then map(select(. != "游戏")) else . end) else . end)'
